{"id":"prezhnij","lemma":"прежний","pos":"adj","rank":4973,"glosses":["former, previous"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/15/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"прежнее","feminine":"прежняя","plural":"прежние"},"examples":[{"text":"В прежние времена было лучше.","en":"It was better in the old days.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Ты уже не так молод, как в прежние времена.","en":"You're not as young as you used to be.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/664356","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"already"},null,null,null,{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"wrong"]]},{"text":"Всё вернулось в прежнее русло.","en":"Things are back to how they used to be.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to return","l":"вернуться"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"riverbed"}]},{"text":"Том поставил книгу на её прежнее место на полке.","en":"Tom put the book back on the shelf where it belonged.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to put","l":"поставить"},null,{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"her"},null,{"g":"place, spot"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"regiment","l":"полк"}]},{"text":"Прежние владельцы нашего дома переехали в Ливерпуль.","en":"The previous owners of our house moved to Liverpool.","words":[null,{"g":"owner","l":"владелец"},{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"at home"},{"g":"to move","l":"переехать"},{"g":"in"},null]}]}